    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题1：全景图怎么采集？采集时需要注意什么？",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_6.txt",
      "offset": 2381486348720
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答：采用鱼眼镜头以5°的方式360°旋转摄像机的方式采集图像，一个场景拍摄前后左右",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_7.txt",
      "offset": 2381479211568
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "上下六张图。采集时要注意保持拍摄设备的稳定。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_8.txt",
      "offset": 2381486348976
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题2：为什么要对材质球进行反转法线的处理？",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_9.txt",
      "offset": 2381486348592
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答：反转法线处理就是将三维模型的面全部反转过来，产生的效果相当于把虚拟摄像机放入",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_10.txt",
      "offset": 2381479214608
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "模型内部，这样的操作更有利于观察。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_11.txt",
      "offset": 2381467465888
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题3：如何实现场景切换?",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_12.txt",
      "offset": 2381467465664
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答:通过使用脚本代码控制材质球的切换来达到场景切换的效果。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_13.txt",
      "offset": 2381467169776
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "该毕业设计实现基于虚拟现实的三维全景仿真，较好地完成了任务书要求的内容，",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_14.txt",
      "offset": 2381479214768
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "但指标不够明确，通过验收。",
