    {
      "id": 24,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题1：设计的仿真较现有的仿真什么创新的地方？",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_7.txt",
      "offset": 2381486347824
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答：现有虚拟现实仿真大部分是采用构建三维模型的方式，而本次设计采用的是",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_8.txt",
      "offset": 2381467170064
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "利用全景图进行序列建模的方式进行仿真的，这种方式真实度更高、数据量更小。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_9.txt",
      "offset": 2381479210608
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题2：设计时遇到什么问题吗？怎么解决的？",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_10.txt",
      "offset": 2381486348080
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答:在图像拼接融合过程中出现了鬼影现象，采用了最佳缝合线算法来解决该问",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_11.txt",
      "offset": 2381467169920
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "题。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_12.txt",
      "offset": 2381487373040
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "问题3：仿真有什么评判标准？",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_13.txt",
      "offset": 2381479531040
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "答：仿真运行在1分钟以内，虚拟场景的真实感、清晰度以及切换过渡是否平滑。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_5_para_14.txt",
      "offset": 2381479199088
    },
